<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Donald Trump</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1946">1946</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Donald Trump (born 1946) is an American businessman and Republican politician who served as the 45th president of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a> from 2017 to 2021 and became the 47th president in January 2025. His administrations restricted immigration and raised tariffs; in his second term he demanded greater US control over the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/panama-canal">Panama Canal</a> and in late 2025 pardoned the former Honduran president <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/juan-orlando-hernandez">Juan Orlando Hernández</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/donald-trump.jpg" alt="Donald Trump" width="320" height="400" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Daniel Torok · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Official_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_(2025).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
